 "about": "Cases for TranscriptFormats, what a recording turned into text is shared as, read by both OzenKitTests (TranscriptFormatsSharedCasesTests, Swift) and core TranscriptFormatsSharedCasesTest (Kotlin). clock: TranscriptFormats.clock(input). text and srt: TranscriptFormats.text and .srt of lines ([start seconds, end seconds, text] each) for the recording's language code. Invisible direction marks are written as \\u escapes. The expected answers were written from the Swift side and checked by the Kotlin one.",
